{"name": "The Unnamed", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For as long as anyone can remember, spirits have run rampant through the human realm, terrorizing innocents. From their wake rise Wanderers: devoted hunters who stop at nothing to keep the spirit threat at bay. As Ao, explore the intricacies of the spirit realm, master his dynamic fighting style, and prove yourself again in a world filled with opposition. <br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/74887698a0fa0b2892a9a9ccffe7c011.poster.avif?t=1777537494\" width=\"950\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/74887698a0fa0b2892a9a9ccffe7c011.webm?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/74887698a0fa0b2892a9a9ccffe7c011.mp4?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take full control of your every move with command-input-based combat. Perform highly technical moves while still being stylish with martial arts and magical relics.   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every attack can be changed with a different direction input</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every parry needs to be matched with the enemy's attack direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juggle airborne enemies to create combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>gadgets</strong> and <strong>sigils</strong> from your companion to aid in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.poster.avif?t=1777537494\" width=\"950\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.webm?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.mp4?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where spirits prowl like wild beasts, a select few rise to the challenge of roaming the earth to defend the helpless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Presented with the chance to venture into the spirit realm, Ao must go where no man has gone before and destroy spirits' access to humanity once and for all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"368\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.poster.avif?t=1777537494\" width=\"950\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.webm?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.mp4?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charms, relics, and secrets pave the path through this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the enchanting but brutal spirit realm, gain strength through battles fought, and uncover the truth of these two worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" 